Subject: [PATCH] fix(facts): the new job stays present when the line also says
 the old one ended; a mentioned save says it was kept as a note (4555)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Tester seats 182796/182797, read-only: besides the stated employer
„საცდელი ლოჯისტიკა", both carried a past_role „საცდელ ლოჯისტიკა" — the
CURRENT job. The background fact extraction reads the tense from the
whole line, and „…ბანკიდან წამოვიდა, ახლა …ლოჯისტიკაში მუშაობს" holds
„წამოვიდა". The tense is now read from the clause that names the value
(split at . ; ! ? and commas); a value found in no clause is read alone.

4555: after a web claim, the reply said „შევინახე: ბახვა, სამსახური:
„სანიმუშო ბანკი"" though the bank was kept only as a mentioned note.
That save's result now says so, as data: kept_as: "mentioned_note",
stated_value_unchanged: true. No model-facing prose is added.

